idea-plugin.description:
Generate openapi Annotation from Javadoc<br>
    Generate openapi annotations based on doc comments of class field / methods.<br>
    If there is @RestController or @Controller annotation on the target class, or the class name ends with Controller, the corresponding controller openapi annotation is generated, otherwise the model openapi annotation is generated.<br>
    You can generate specified openapi annotations by selecting the class name, field name, and method name.<br>
    The following annotation format can be automatically filled in the annotation value.<br>
    根据类属性/方法的 javadoc 注释生成 openapi 注解。<br>
    如果目标类上有 @RestController 或 @Controller 注解或类名以 Controller 结尾，则生成对应 controller openapi 注解，否则生成 model openapi 注解。<br>
    可通过选中类名、字段名、方法名生成指定 openapi 注解。<br>
    以下注释格式可自动填充到注解 value 中。<br>
    <pre>        /**
         * test
         * @apiNote test
         */
        @ApiModelProperty("test test")
        private String test1;

        // test
        @ApiModelProperty("test")
        private String test2;

        /**
         *
         */
        @ApiModelProperty("")
        private String test3;

        @ApiModelProperty(hidden = true)
        private String test4;

        /**
         * test
         */
        @ApiModelProperty(value="test", required = true)
        @NotBlank
        private String test5;
        </pre>

