idea-plugin.description:
SpinnerHelper is a professional plugin designed for IntelliJ IDEA to enhance 3DE development efficiency.
        It optimizes the development experience through intelligent deployment processes and a rich set of auxiliary tools.

        <h2>SpinnerHelper - 3DE开发效率提升插件</h2>
        <p><code>SpinnerHelper</code> 是一款专为 IntelliJ IDEA 设计的专业级插件，致力于优化 3DE 开发体验。通过智能化的部署流程和丰富的辅助工具集，显著提升开发效率与便捷性。</p>
        <p><strong>内嵌连接器:</strong>插件包含 <a href="https://gitee.com/bliang0114/SpinnerHelper/releases/download/3.2.1/matrix-connector-1.5.0.jar">matrix-connector-1.5.0.jar</a>，可在驱动配置中点击“使用 matrix-connector”安装，也可通过链接下载。ENOVIA 厂商依赖需按服务器版本自行配置。</p>
        <h3>🚀 核心功能</h3>
        <h4>多环境管理</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>多版本支持</strong>：灵活配置不同 3DE 版本环境</li>
          <li><strong>环境切换</strong>：一键实现在不同开发环境间的无缝切换</li>
        </ul>
        <h4>快速部署</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Spinner 文件部署</strong>：通过右键菜单快速执行配置文件的增量或全量部署</li>
          <li><strong>JPO 文件部署</strong>：提供完整的 JPO 文件部署支持</li>
        </ul>
        <h4>实用工具集</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>MQL Console</strong>：集成化控制台，直接执行 MQL 命令</li>
          <li><strong>URL Parameter Parse</strong>：便捷的 URL 参数解析功能</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>⚙️ 技术特性</h3>
        <p>优化了 <code>EnoBrowserJPO</code> 的 <code>runScript</code> 方法，以获得更好的日志反馈：</p>
        <pre><code>
        public String runScript(Context ctx, String[] args) throws Exception {
            if (adminOnly)
                checkAdmin(ctx);
            String[] cmdarray = Arrays.copyOf(args, args.length - 2);
            String dir = args[args.length - 2];
            String output = args[args.length - 1];
            ProcessBuilder pb = new ProcessBuilder(cmdarray);
            pb.directory(new File(dir));
            pb.redirectErrorStream(true);
            Process p = pb.start();
            StreamWriter sw = new StreamWriter(p.getInputStream(), output);
            sw.run();
            return readFile(ctx, new String[]{output});
        }
        </code></pre>
        <h3>📋 配置要求</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>IDEA 版本</strong>：仅支持 IntelliJ IDEA 2025.1 及以上版本</li>
          <li><strong>依赖准备</strong>：需自行准备对应 3DE 版本的依赖包</li>
        </ul>

TabReorder plugin allows to reorder and move editor tabs using keyboard shortcuts.
        <br>Default shortcuts, but I recommend checking them with your current keymap (on Mac Control is the Cmd):
        <br>- <i>Control+Alt+Shift+Left</i> to move tab left;
        <br>- <i>Control+Alt+Shift+Right</i> to move tab right;
        <br>- <i>Control+Alt+Shift+Up</i> to make tab first;
        <br>- <i>Control+Alt+Shift+Down</i> to make tab last;
        <br>- <i>no default keystroke</i> to move tab to previous splitter (tabgroup) within the same window;
        <br>- <i>no default keystroke</i> to make tab to next splitter (tabgroup) within the same window;
        <br>- <i>Control+Alt+Shift+PageUp</i> to move tab to previous splitter or window (depending on which comes first);
        <br>- <i>Control+Alt+Shift+PageDown</i> to make tab to next splitter or window (depending on which comes first);
        <br>- <i>Control+Alt+Shift+OpenBracket</i> to focus previous splitter or window (depending on which comes first);
        <br>- <i>Control+Alt+Shift+CloseBracket</i> to focus next splitter or window (depending on which comes first);
        <br>- <i>Control+Alt+Shift+D</i> to open a new window with the current tab;
        <br>- <i>Control+Alt+Shift+P,P</i> to move all pinned tabs to the beginning of the tablist;
        <br>- <i>Control+Alt+Shift+P,T</i> to pin all tabs that are not pinned. Or if all tabs are pinned, unpin all;
        <br>- <i>Alt+Shift+T</i> show action popup with possible actions;
        <br>The plugin is open source (LGPL).
        1.5
        <p>If you find this plugin useful, please consider inviting me for a beer.
        I develop this plugin in my free time and I'm more motivated when I have a beer on desk :-)

        <br> http://PayPal.Me/mnwDevelopment/</p>

