Android multi-language development tool, batch conversion between strings.xml and Excel.Mainly used in Android development multi-language scenarios, or similar scenarios, the main functions are as follows:
  1. Convert the contents of multiple strings.xml files to the same Excel file;
  2. Convert the content of an Excel file to multiple strings.xml files;
  3. Check the null value of the same attributes in multiple strings.xml files and mark them in the Excel file;

  You can access the plugin from the "View" menu at the IDE toolbar;

MCP extension for obtaining Java class source code
        config:
        "java_source": {
            "url": "http://localhost:6699/mcp"
